{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fish_salmon","model_identifier":"salmon","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"Survive and Conquer \u2014 SALMON\n============================================================\nadult salmon: deeper silver-pink body, forked caudal, adipose\n\nSCALE\n  1 unit = 2.8125 cm\n  length: 28.00 u = 78.75 cm = 0.787 m\n  body depth (excl. fins): 5.20 u = 14.6 cm  (half-ht param 2.60)\n  body width: 2.30 u = 6.5 cm\n  hit box (W x H x D): 3.8 x 8.5 x 28.5 u\n\nORIGIN\n  Mid-body centre at (0,0,0). Facing -Z (head toward -Z, tail +Z).\n  Belly sits below y=0 by ~half body height; game places the unit at swim depth.\n  Creature right = +X.\n\nCUBES: 32   BONES: 14\n  chain: root > body_front > body_mid > body_rear > tail > caudal\n  fins: dorsal, anal, pectoral_r/l, pelvic_r/l, adipose\n\nANIMATIONS\n  idle: 2.400 s, loop=loop\n  swim: 1.000 s, loop=loop\n  swim designed speed: 1.50 m/s = 53.3 u/s (in-place cycle; game translates the root)\n  idle: gentle fin scull + slow body sway, 2.40 s loop\n\nNo attack / death / injured clips (commission: idle + swim only).\n\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"snout","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.8855,-0.715,-14.0],"to":[0.8855,0.7865,-12.32],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,-10.92],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[142.0,2.0,144.0,4.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[144.0,2.0,146.0,4.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[146.0,2.0,148.0,4.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[140.0,2.0,142.0,4.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[142.0,0.0,144.0,2.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[144.0,0.0,146.0,2.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"3a47337b-5f41-5aa2-8d09-bed5e40ac1fd"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":tru